3:["$","li","01",{"children":["One continuous page",". ","Barba.js turns the site into a single-page app, so a change of page is a transition rather than a reload. Snap-scroll navigation, animated text reveals and fade transitions on GSAP."]}]
4:["$","li","02",{"children":["The Impressions slider",". ","Swiper.js and three.js together: a WebGL shader slider on desktop, and on mobile the same gallery becomes a smooth scroll that handles every image orientation."]}]
5:["$","li","03",{"children":["Masked reveals",". ","Swiper pushed further for masked transitions and image reveals, checked to stay fluid on every device rather than only the fast ones."]}]
6:["$","li","04",{"children":["Editable everywhere",". ","Webflow CMS holds the texts, images and crafts, so the studio changes content without touching code."]}]
